# The top of the brick parapet seen from above: a pale stone coping. Frame
# m<n> is a bitmask of which neighbours are also caps: north 1, east 2, south
# 4, west 8. Every open side gets an ink edge, lit on the north and west,
# shaded on the south and east, so it matches the plaster cap where they meet.
sprite wall-brick-cap
size 16 16
layer wall
tag wall

frame m0
k*kkkkkkkkkkkk|k
k**************k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
k*++++++++++++|k
|||||||||||||||k
kkkkkkkkkkkkkk|k

